From 5644771764eb00ad1740387166c8aad16dd93efb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jonas=20=C3=85dahl?= <jadahl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:51:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] session: Add 'starting' signal

